tique":"This is a pasted thread. The output capitalizes sentences and 'North Loop', and expands the shorthand 'ok' to 'okay' and '+' to 'and'. Speaker labels are kept as written. All times (4–5, 1:20, 12:55, 3, 2:30), quantities, the conditions ('don't move anything without checking with me') and the uncertainty about the sparkling water are preserved.","input_verdict":"pass","output_verdict":"pass","pair_verdict":"pass","verdict":"pass"},{"id":"arka-v3-train-slack-0299","row_sha256":"b6689e83286b8ef0f033b2cf8a9ba6f764b3076bebc0306b6712a7c410abecd2","critique":"I checked the long thread turn by turn. Edits are limited to:
